OL,3,GNEWSABus fare cap putting Far North
OL,4,Atrain line at risk, say campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe #2 cap on bus fares in the north of
OL,7,FScotland could halt investment in rail
OL,8,Fservices as passengers desert the more
OL,9,Fexpensive train network, campaigners
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FIan Budd, convener of The Friends of
OL,13,Fthe Far North Line, said the Scottish
OL,14,Fgovernment had "effectively shot
OL,15,Fthemselves in the foot" by capping bus
OL,16,Ffares, making them far less expensive
OL,17,Fthan rail services covering the same
OL,18,Froute.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
