OL,3,GNEWSABus fare cap putting Far North
OL,4,Atrain line at risk, say campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile a single bus journey from Thurso
OL,7,Fto Inverness now costs just #2, the
OL,8,Fsame journey by train costs between
OL,9,F#16.60 and #28.
OL,11,FTransport Scotland told the BBC it
OL,12,Fwould continue to monitor the impact of
OL,13,Fthe #2 bus fare cap on passenger
OL,14,Fnumbers and wider transport behaviour.
